==History==
2016
*The Miner [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/5/2016, in the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Miner's hitpoints by 6% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], decreased the Miner's deploy time to 0.75 seconds (from 1 second) {{Balance|Buff}}. This change was not mentioned in any change notes and was later said to be unintentional by Supercell.
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Miner's deploy to 1 second (from 0.75 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}} and decreased his hitpoints by 6% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Miner from Builder's Workshop to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5) {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2019
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], decreased the Miner's range to 1.2 tiles (from 1.3 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}, now classified as Melee: Medium.
*On 7/10/2019, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (7/10/2019)|maintenance break]], added a new [[Star Points|Star Level]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Miner's card info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
2020
*On 3/3/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/3/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Miner's [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] damage to 35% of the full damage (from 40%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Miner's Crown Tower damage to 30% of the full damage (from 35%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], slightly changed the Miner's description, adding the line "''A shovel that deals reduced damage to Crown Towers.''" {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 2/9/2021, a maintenance break, changed the Miner's card render {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Miner from P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse to Electro Valley {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2023
*On 4/4/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/4/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Miner's Crown Tower damage to 25% of the full damage (from 30%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Miner's damage by 0.51% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Miner's attack time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.2 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2026

* On 6/7/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Miner's Crown Tower damage to 20% of the full damage (from 25%)

